nPublic%20Consultation%20Emails.pdf\">Sample Non-Public Consultation Emails</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Non-Public%20Complaint%20Process%20-%206.8.2026.pdf\">Non-Public Complaint Process</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>ESEA Training for New Coordinators</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<p><strong>Role &amp; Program Overviews</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Role%20of%20the%20ESEA%20Coordinator%20-%207.20.2026.pdf\">Role of the ESEA Coordinator</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mV7Guo4Ca3o\">Role of the ESEA Coordinator Video</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EmOosUebeHo\">Title I, Part A</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_nXqF5j3cs\">Title II</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DJvnnni61bQ\">Title III</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q9MoaD__vkk\">Title IV, Part A</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIiTp22jP0I\">Title V</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-6\">\r\n<p><strong>Grant Management &amp; Applications</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCIGETYraYM\">Working with ESEA Grant Programs</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qlyab-FE11Q\">Grants4ME</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"list-group-item\"><a href=\"ht