aine.gov.doe/files/2024-02/Sample%20NonPublic%20Consultation%20Emails.pdf\">Sample Non-Public Consultation Emails</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Non-Public%20Complaint%20Process%20-%206.8.2026.pdf\">Non-Public Complaint Process</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card\">\r\n<div class=\"card-header text-white bg-primary\"><strong>ESEA Training for New Coordinators</strong></div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"card-body\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-3\">\r\n<p><strong>Role &amp; Program Overviews</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"/doe/sites/maine.gov.doe/files/inline-files/ESEA%20-%20Role%20of%20the%20ESEA%20Coordinator%20-%207.20.2026.pdf\">Role of the ESEA Coordinator</a></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mV7Guo4Ca3o\">Role of the ESEA Coordinator</a><span class=\"doe-chip\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=EmOosUebeHo\">Title I, Part A</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=M_nXqF5j3cs\">Title II</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DJvnnni61bQ\">Title III</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=q9MoaD__vkk\">Title IV, Part A</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=qIiTp22jP0I\">Title V</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"col-sm-9\">\r\n<p><strong>Grant Management &amp; Applications</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<ul class=\"list-group list-group-flush\">\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=XCIGETYraYM\">Working with ESEA Grant Programs</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=Qlyab-FE11Q\">Grants4ME</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=mEDXnYy_6w8\">Application Workflow</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n\t<li class=\"doe-action list-group-item\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pQUPVRmu1gg\">Important ESEA Application Considerations</a><span class=\"doe-chip\" data-src=\"file\">Video</span></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"blockhead\" id=\"office-hours-esea-federal-programs\">\r\n<h2>Office Hours: ESEA Federal Programs</h2>\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"table table-bordered\" width=\"100%\">\r\n\t<thead>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:12%\">Date</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\">Topics Covered</th>\r\n\t\t\t<th scope=\"col\" style=\"width:15%; text-align:center\">Recording</th>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t</thead>\r\n\t<tbody>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>September 8, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>FY27 ESEA Application, FY26 Title I Summer Grant Performance Report, FY26 Title I Ed-Flex and Excess Carryover, FY27 ESEA Monitoring, FY28 Title I Equitable Services; Fiscal Corner: Business Manager Bootcamp, Invoicing Reminders, Contractual Services, Expiring Funds</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uGIvTKSu86s\">Video</a> (20 minutes)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>August 11, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>FY27 ESEA Application,&nbsp;New ESEA Coordinator Training Series,&nbsp;Title I Summer Grant, Title I Intent and Purpose Guidance, Title I Excess Carryover, Title V SRSA Award; Fiscal Corner: Accrued Salaries, Contractual Services, Title I Carryover, Invoicing Reminders</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ptirYf9mLN4\">Video</a> (18 minutes)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>June 9, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>FY27 ESEA Application, Ed-Flex Waiver, Schoolwide Applications, Equitable Services Consultation, Title I Summer Grant funding. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Invoicing Reminders, Contractual Services, Period of Performance, Title I Part A Carryover.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"June 9 2026 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xppNgFGlsO0\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(29 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>April 14, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>FY27 Preliminary Application, ESEA Public Comment Period and Ed-Flex Waiver, FY27 Application and New Coordinator Training, FY26 Title I Summer. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Federal Fiscal Office Hours, Grant Period of Performance.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"April 14 2026 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=6kGkoZrtkxY\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(47 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>March 10, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>ESEA Team Update, Ed-Flex Waiver Update, FY26 ESEA Monitoring, FY26 Title I Summer Application, Title I Schoolwide Template Updates, FY27 Equitable Services. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Federal Fiscal Office Hours, Budgets and Reminders, Grant Period of Performance.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"March 10 2026 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=p-CRm6027U0\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(20 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>February 10, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>Maine DOE's Ed-Flex Application, Past Due Notifications, Title I Summer Reallocated Grant, Title I Schoolwide Application, Equitable Services Required Training. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Invoicing Reminders, Written Policies and Procedures, Contract Signatures, Expiring Grants.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"February 10 2026 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8rRD7WJf9Oo\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(23 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>January 13, 2026</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>USED Announcement, FY25 ESEA Performance Report, FY26 Monitoring, Title I Schoolwide, Title I CoP. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Travel Reimbursements, Invoicing, Obligations, Federal Fiscal Office Hours.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"January 13 2026 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=m00OWDffNUA\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(41 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>December 9, 2025</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>USED Announcement, FY25 ESEA Performance Report, FY26 Monitoring, Family Engagement Set-Aside, Title III Immigrant Grant. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Travel Reimbursement Rate Updates, FY26 Substantial Approval Dates, Obligations, Expiring Funds and Grants.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"December 9 2025 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=9FvXT_T2jGg\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(19 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t<tr>\r\n\t\t\t<td><strong>November 12, 2025</strong></td>\r\n\t\t\t<td>FY26 ESEA Consolidated, FY26 ESEA Monitoring, FY25 ESEA Consolidated Performance Report. <em>Fiscal Corner:</em> Reimbursements, invoicing, period of performance.</td>\r\n\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align:center;\"><a aria-label=\"November 12 2025 Office Hour Recording\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=_J-1RF0xDxk\">Video</a><br />\r\n\t\t\t(19 min)</td>\r\n\t\t</tr>\r\n\t\t